  era: "Late Mesolithic \xB7 Section 1 \xB7 Prehistoric India \xB7 c. 1.5 million years ago \u2013 700 BCE"
  title: Early domestication
  text: Late in the Mesolithic, some groups began keeping animals. Bones from Adamgarh in Madhya Pradesh and Bagor in Rajasthan suggest early domestication of sheep, goats and cattle, a step towards herding and settled life.
